  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## STIR/SHAKEN — attestation & inbound verification\nLive from VictoriaMetrics (`voip-metrics-vm`) — the Kamailio SBCs' `xhttp_prom` counters, scraped per-zone by vmagent. Two families:\n- **Signed attestation** (`kamailio_stir_attest_signed{attestation, zone}`) — what WE signed on each **outbound carrier leg**. `A` full (authenticated origin, e.g. trunk/API) · `B` partial (SHAKEN default) · `C` gateway (RCF forward of an unsigned inbound) · **`div`** = chained onto a preserved inbound Identity (best outcome — we relayed the upstream attestation) · `unsigned` = nothing signed (fail-open / signing off).\n- **Inbound verstat** (`kamailio_stir_inbound_verstat{verstat, source, zone}`) — the inbound caller-verification result. `source=self` = our own `secsipid_check_identity`; `source=carrier` = Bandwidth's `verstat=` lifted off the P-Asserted-Identity.\n\n`zone` = **SBC_ID** (e.g. `east-sbc-1`); the **Zone** picker maps to a `zone=~\"$zone\"` regex (`east-.*` / `west-.*` / `central-.*`, or `.*` = all). All ratios/mixes are over the dashboard time range (`$__range`)."
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Signed attestation mix ($__range)",
      "description": "Share of outbound carrier legs by the attestation WE signed, over the selected range: sum by (attestation) (increase(kamailio_stir_attest_signed{zone=~\"$zone\"}[$__range])). Colour-mapped to the UI: A green, B amber, C gray, div blue, unsigned red. Honours the Zone filter.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "voip-metrics-vm" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "voip-metrics-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (attestation) (increase(kamailio_stir_attest_signed{zone=~\"$zone\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{attestation}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "values": ["value", "percent"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "A" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "B" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "C" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "div" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "unsigned" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "% div — chained (best outcome, $__range)",
      "description": "Fraction of signed outbound legs that chained onto a preserved inbound Identity (attestation=div) over the range: sum(increase(...{attestation=\"div\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(...[$__range])). Higher = more calls where we relayed the upstream attestation intact (the best STIR outcome). Honours the Zone filter.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "voip-metrics-vm" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "voip-metrics-vm" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(kamailio_stir_attest_signed{attestation=\"div\", zone=~\"$zone\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(kamailio_stir_attest_signed{zone=~\"$zone\"}[$__range])), 1)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "div"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
